    {
      "source": "Returns a new <a href=\"StructuredOutputChatOptions.Builder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.model.tool\"><code>StructuredOutputChatOptions.Builder</code></a> initialized with the\nvalues of this <a href=\"StructuredOutputChatOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.model.tool\"><code>StructuredOutputChatOptions</code></a>.\n\nNarrows the return type of <a href=\"../../chat/prompt/ChatOptions.html#mutate()\"><code>ChatOptions.mutate()</code></a> so generic structured\noutput code can chain\n<code>structuredOptions.mutate().outputSchema(schema).build()</code> without casting.",
      "translation": "返回一个新的 <a href=\"StructuredOutputChatOptions.Builder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.model.tool\"><code>StructuredOutputChatOptions.Builder</code></a>，该对象已初始化为当前 <a href=\"StructuredOutputChatOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.model.tool\"><code>StructuredOutputChatOptions</code></a> 的值。\n\n将 <a href=\"../../chat/prompt/ChatOptions.html#mutate()\"><code>ChatOptions.mutate()</code></a> 的返回类型收窄，以便通用结构化输出代码可以无需强制转换即可链式调用\n<code>structuredOptions.mutate().outputSchema(schema).build()</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a new <a href=\"StructuredOutputChatOptions.Builder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.model.tool\"><code>StructuredOutputChatOptions.Builder</code></a> initialized with the\nvalues of this <a href=\"StructuredOutputChatOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.model.tool\"><code>StructuredOutputChatOptions</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一个新的<a href=\"StructuredOutputChatOptions.Builder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.model.tool\"><code>StructuredOutputChatOptions.Builder</code></a>，该对象已使用此<a href=\"StructuredOutputChatOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.model.tool\"><code>StructuredOutputChatOptions</code></a>的值进行初始化。",
      "count": 1
